    "AMP saved index includes one extra rollout vs SuperMimic, difference0.01% at10k.",
    "Joint acceleration is a physical smoothness proxy, not a sufficient measure of naturalness; failure to move can also lower it.",
    "Only10k-spaced checkpoints: earliest observed attainment is not exact convergence time; connecting plot lines are visual guides, not measured interpolation.",
